er/Motorcycle/Moped.\n31.\nCar/Jeep/Van.\n32.\nMain Cereal consumed in the household.\n33.\nMobile Number (for census related communications only).\n[F. No. 9/8/2025-CD (Cen)] MRITUNJAY KUMAR NARAYAN, Registrar General and Census Commissioner, India.\n_____________\nGovernment Central Press, Jaipur.", "source": "KanoonGPT/indian-legal-documents"}
