{"document_id": "f56052bf203c0de96a03470cc2bbcbff5a89fe32b21c0313644ecf8f8c27d931", "canonical_type": "Order", "document_type": "Order", "document_title": "Steel and Steel Products (Quality Control) Amendment Order, 2025", "document_jurisdiction": "Central", "issuing_authority": "Ministry of Steel, Government of India", "issue_date": "2025-11-20", "text": "रजि�री सं. डी.एल.- 33004/99\nREGD. No. D. L.-33004/99\n==> picture [48 x 81] intentionally omitted <==\n==> picture [79 x 32] intentionally omitted <==\n==> picture [61 x 32] intentionally omitted <==\nसी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-20112025-267864 xxxGIDHxxx CG-DL-E-20112025-267864 xxx GIDE xxx\nअसाधारण EXTRAORDINARY भाग II — ख� ड 3 — उप-ख� ड (ii) PART II—Section 3—Sub-section (ii)\n�ाजधकार से �काजित PUBLISHED BY AUTHORITY\nसं. 5305] नई दद�ली, बृह� पजतवार, नव� बर 20, 2025/ का�तवक 29, 1947 No. 5305] NEW DELHI, THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 20, 2025/KARTIKA 29, 1947\nइ�पात मं�ालय\nआदेि\nनई दद�ली, 20 नव� बर, 2025\nका.आ. 5134(अ).— भारतीय मानक �यूरो अजधजनयम, 2016 (2016 का 11) की धारा 17 और धारा 25 की उपधारा (3) के साथ पठित धारा 16 �ारा �द� िजिय� का �योग करते �ए, के�र सरकार की राय है दक सावविजनक जहत म� ऐसा करना आव�यक या समीचीन है औरभारतीय मानक �यूरो से परामिव करने के प�ात, इ�पात और इ�पात उ�पाद (गुणव�ा जनयं�ण) आदेि, 2024 को संिोजधत करने के जलए एत�ारा जन�जलजखत आदेि देती है, अथावत:-\n1.\nसंजि� िी�वक और लागू होना - (1) इस आदेि को इ�पात और इ�पात उ�पाद (गुणव�ा जनयं�ण) संिोधन आदेि, 2025 कहा िाएगा।\n-\n(2) यह िासकीय रािप� म� इसके �कािन की जन�दव� तारीखसे लागू होगा।\n2.\nइ�पात और इ�पात उ�पाद (गुणव�ा जनयं�ण) आदेि, 2024 म�–\n7773 GI/2025\n(1)\n2\n[PART II—SEC. 3(ii)]\nTHE GAZETTE OF INDIA: EXTRAORDINARY\n-\n(क) अनुसूची 1 म�, �म सं�या 24, 37, 48, 55, 68, 69, 73, 74, 75, 76, 77, 79, 81,82, 83, 87, 88, 90, 95, 96, 97, 98, 99, 101, 104, 105, 106, 107, 112, 113, 114, 115, 116, 117, 118, 119, 120, 123, 124, 125, 150 और 151 पर आईएस सं�या और आईएस िी�वक का �वतवन और उनसे संबंजधत �जवज�यांरािप� म� �कािन की तारीख से 3 व�व की अवजधके जलए लागू नह� ह�गी।\n-\n(ख) अनुसूची 1 म�, �म सं�या 49, 50, 60, 64, 86, 92, 93, 94, 102, 128, 132, 135 और 137 पर आईएस सं�या और आईएस िी�वक का �वतवन और उनसे संबंजधत �जवज�यां रािप� म� �कािन की तारीख से 1 व�व की अवजधके जलए लागू नह� ह�गी।\n[फा. सं. एस-20011/33/2025-तकनीकी]\nअजभिीत नरे�र, संयु� त सजचव\n-\nनोट: इ�पात और इ�पात उ�पाद (गुणव�ा जनयं�ण) आदेि, 2024, भारत के रािप�, असाधारण, भाग II-ख�ड 3(ii), का.आ. 3716 (अ), ददनांक 29 अग�त, 2024 के तहत �काजित दकया गया था।\nMINISTRY OF STEEL ORDER\nNew Delhi, the 20th November, 2025\nS.O. 5134(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by section 16 read with section 17 and sub-section (3) of section 25 of the Bureau of Indian Standards Act, 2016 (11 of 2016), the Central Government is of the opinion that it is necessary or expedient so to do in the public interest, after consulting the Bureau of Indian Standards hereby makes the following order to amend the Steel and Steel Products (Quality Control) Order, 2024, namely: -\n1.\nShort title and commencement. - (1) This order may be called the Steel and Steel Products (Quality Control) Amendment Order, 2025.\n-\n(2) It shall come into force on the date of its publication in the Official Gazette.\n2.\nIn the Steel and Steel Products (Quality Control) Order, 2024, -\n-\n(a) in Schedule 1, enforcement of IS Number and IS Title at serial numbers 24, 37, 48, 55, 68, 69, 73, 74, 75, 76, 77, 79, 81, 82, 83, 87, 88, 90, 95, 96, 97, 98, 99, 101, 104, 105, 106, 107, 112, 113, 114, 115, 116, 117, 118, 119, 120, 123, 124, 125, 150 and 151 and the entries relating thereto shall not be operative for a period of 3 years from date of publication in the gazette.\n-\n(b) in schedule 1, enforcement of IS Number and IS Title at serial numbers 49, 50, 60, 64, 86, 92, 93, 94, 102, 128, 132, 135 and 137 and the entries relating thereto shall not be operative for a period of 1 year from date of publication in the gazette.\n[F. No. S-20011/33/2025-TECH]\nABHIJIT NARENDRA, Jt. Secy.\n-\nNote: The Steel and Steel Products (Quality Control) Order, 2024 was published in the Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part II, Section 3, Sub-section (ii), dated the 30[th] August, 2024, vide number S.O. 3716 (E), dated the 29th August, 2024.\nUploaded by Dte. of Printing at Government of India Press, Ring Road, Mayapuri, New Delhi-110064 and Published by the Controller of Publications, Delhi-110054.\nAMIT KUMAR JAISWAL Digitally signed by AMIT KUMAR JAISWAL Date: 2025.11.20 19:25:14 +05'30'", "source": "KanoonGPT/indian-legal-documents"}
{"document_id": "f5ba94bf4ebdfdd83b061498c9e37b5a9bc55f73f86ca8bd78b0303f9e4de2ec", "canonical_type": "Order", "document_type": "Order", "document_title": "Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Second Amendment Order, 2025", "document_jurisdiction": "Central", "issuing_authority": "Ministry of Heavy Industries", "issue_date": "2025-11-13", "text": "रजि�री सं. डी.एल.- 33004/99\nREGD. No. D. L.-33004/99\n==> picture [49 x 80] intentionally omitted <==\n==> picture [80 x 32] intentionally omitted <==\n==> picture [60 x 33] intentionally omitted <==\nसी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-14112025-267651 xxxGIDHxxx CG-DL-E-14112025-267651 xxx GIDE xxx\nअसाधारण EXTRAORDINARY\nभाग II — ख� ड 3 — उप-ख� ड (ii) PART II—Section 3—Sub-section (ii)\n�ाजधकार से �काजित PUBLISHED BY AUTHORITY\nसं. 5010] नई दद�ली, बृह� पजतवार, नव� बर 13, 2025/ का�तशक 22, 1947 No. 5010] NEW DELHI, THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 13, 2025/KARTIKA 22, 1947\nभारी उ�ोग मं�ालय\nआदेि\n==> picture [123 x 12] intentionally omitted <==\nका.आ. 5179(अ).— चूंदक भारतीय मानक �यूरो अजधजनयम, 2016 (2016 का 11) की धारा 17 और धारा 25 के साथ पठित धारा 16 �ारा �द� िजिय� का �योग करते �ए, के�र सरकार, यह राय रखते �ए दक िनजहत म� ऐसा करना आव�यक और समीचीन है, और भारतीय मानक �यूरो के परामिश से, मिीनरी और जव�ुत उपकरण सुर�ा (सावशज�क तकनीकी जवजनयमन) आदेि, 2024 को संिोजधत करने के जलए जन�जलजखत आदेि िारी करती है, अथाशत्:-\n1.\n(1) इस आदेि को मिीनरी और जव�ुत उपकरण सुर�ा (सावशज�क तकनीकी जवजनयमन) ज�तीय संिोधन आदेि, 2025 कहा िाएगा।\n-\n(2) यह आजधकाठरक रािप� म� �कािन की तारीख से �वृ� होगा।\n2.\nमिीनरी और जव�ुत उपकरण सुर�ा (सावशज�क तकनीकी जवजनयमन) आदेि, 2024 म�, पैरा 1 के उप-पैरा (2) म� ि�द� \"आजधकाठरक रािप� म� इसके �कािन की तारीख से एक व�श के बाद\", जि�ह� मिीनरी और जव�ुत उपकरण सुर�ा (सावशज�क तकनीकी जवजनयमन) संिोधन आदेि, 2025 के तहत संिोजधत करके \"1 जसतंबर,\n7595 GI/2025\n(1)\n2\n[PART II—SEC. 3(ii)]\nTHE GAZETTE OF INDIA: EXTRAORDINARY\n2026 को\" दकया गया था, के जलए \"ऐसी तारीख से िैसा दक क�र सरकार �ारा आजधकाठरक रािप� म� अजधसूजचत की िाए\" ि�द� को �जत�थाजपत दकया िाएगा।\n[फा. सं. 9/28/2019-एचई एंड एमटी] जविय जम�ल, संयुि सजचव\n-\nनोट: मूल आदेि, अथाशत् मिीनरी और जव�ुत उपकरण सुर�ा (सावशज�क तकनीकी जवजनयमन) आदेि, 2024, भारत का रािप�, असाधारण, भाग II, खंड 3, उप-खंड (ii) म� अजधसूचना सं�या का.आ. 3649(अ), ददनांक 28 अग�त, 2024 �ारा �काजित दकया गया था।\nइसके अलावा, आदेि को मिीनरी और जव�ुत उपकरण सुर�ा (सावशज�क तकनीकी जवजनयमन) संिोधन आदेि, 2025 के मा�यम से अजधसूचना सं�या का.आ. 2579(अ) ददनांक 12 िून, 2025 �ारा संिोजधत दकया गया था।\nMINISTRY OF HEAVY INDUSTRIES\nORDER\nNew Delhi, the 13th November, 2025\nS.O. 5179(E).— Whereas in exercise of the powers conferred by section 16 read with section 17 and section 25 of the Bureau of Indian Standards Act, 2016 (11 of 2016), the Central Government is of the opinion that it is necessary and expedient so to do in the public interest, and in consultation with the Bureau of Indian Standards, hereby makes the following Order to amend the Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Order, 2024, namely:–\n1.\n(1) This Order may be called the Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Second Amendment Order, 2025.\n-\n(2) It shall come into force from the date of its publication in the Official Gazette.\n2.\nIn the Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Order, 2024, in Paragraph 1, sub-Paragraph (2) the words “after one year from the date of its publication in the Official Gazette”, which were amended to “on the 1st September, 2026” vide Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Amendment Order, 2025, the words “from such date as may be notified by the Central Government in the Official Gazette” shall be substituted.\n[F. No. 9/28/2019-HE&MT] VIJAY MITTAL, Jt. Secy.\n-\nNote: The principal Order, namely, the Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Order, 2024, was published in the Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part II, Section 3, Sub-section (ii), vide notification number S.O. 3649(E), dated the 28th August, 2024.Further the order was amended through the Machinery and Electrical Equipment Safety (Omnibus Technical Regulation) Amendment Order, 2025 vide Notification No. S.O. 2579(E) dated 12th June 2025.\nUploaded by Dte. of Printing at Government of India Press, Ring Road, Mayapuri, New Delhi-110064 and Published by the Controller of Publications, Delhi-110054. GORAKHA NATH\nGORAKHA NATH Digitally signed by GORAKHA NATH YADAVA YADAVA Date: 2025.11.14 10:53:12 +05'30'", "source": "KanoonGPT/indian-legal-documents"}
